<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz May unemployment falls to 6.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz May unemployment falls to 6.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Kyrgyzstan fell to 62,600, or 6.8 percent of the workforce, at the end of May from 67,000 people in April, the National Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ UNEMPLOYMENT	 May 97     Apr 97     May 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed	   62,600     67,000     78,000</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	6.8	  7.1	  4.5</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for the total number of unemployed in May and April 1997 are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
